    "summary": "Trousers composed of 75 narrow strips hand-woven and hand-sewn together selvedge to selvedge. Plain woven dyed blue and light blue warps and dyed blue wefts. The trousers are heavily embroidered on front and back in geometric motifs using dyed imported European wool (red, green, white, purple, yellow). The legs of the trousers are decorated with alternating red, green and purple vertical stripes. The waistband is furnished by a length of machine woven cotton dyed blue.",
